{"complete":true,"date":"2026-10-27","records":[{"id":"2026-10-27:statement:6c162ae8a7948952:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":0,"sha256":"6c162ae8a7948952844b9564c423b36061232cb65a60ea0023b02d1900d147d4"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"18:45","verified":false,"words":"Sir, the haze is thick today, almost brown. I’ve kept the windows shut to stop the dust settling on your papers."},{"id":"2026-10-27:statement:a3b8b4df7851e17c:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":2,"sha256":"a3b8b4df7851e17c7eacf310b062746a7b1cc0f4cbf437504b1d816d9f20e059"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"18:45","verified":false,"words":"Thank you, Ramesh. The dust is indeed a stubborn intruder. Please, bring the parathas with the curd and pickle. I find my spirit requires this material support before it can properly engage with the day's remaining tasks."},{"id":"2026-10-27:statement:bd189bad2bdac8e9:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":3,"sha256":"bd189bad2bdac8e954524a65c12de59c60debea536a6997f4e2572bca02dd2d5"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"18:45","verified":false,"words":"Yes, sir. I’ll put a plate together with the morning’s parathas, curd, and pickle. Give me a few minutes."},{"id":"2026-10-27:event:3c6e8bced561ef80:1","kind":"event","place":"home","source":{"collection":"entries","index":4,"sha256":"3c6e8bced561ef801deedb665a1e72c3ed154a53269005cfd55c7fd47fe0eb62"},"text":"Ramesh puts a plate together: parathas kept from the morning, with curd and pickle.","time":"18:45","type":"world"},{"id":"2026-10-27:statement:ea61b7c97d78668b:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":6,"sha256":"ea61b7c97d78668b6732ee90e057d659ac0cb0f3429d65707d0a0e83243f9a6f"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"19:15","verified":false,"words":"Thank you, Ramesh. Take your time."},{"id":"2026-10-27:statement:601ffd407baa9d81:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":7,"sha256":"601ffd407baa9d81be777ec59cd41dcdeed8efb34d1f1e781d5c27f3f8ddd6cd"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"19:15","verified":false,"words":"Chalo, sir. I’ll be quick."},{"id":"2026-10-27:statement:0a1b75c2a7e1b583:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":10,"sha256":"0a1b75c2a7e1b5834782b3d4e317d523caa92273c1dac4f4d6d1519c6b9cc9fb"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"19:45","verified":false,"words":"Ramesh, take this card to the gate. Tell the man who left it that I am not Shri Hegde, but Hegel. And tell him that if he wishes to discuss the allotment, he may do so tomorrow, but not in the manner of a postman dropping paper. The confusion must be resolved, not merely noted."},{"id":"2026-10-27:statement:fac0574e1a857058:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":11,"sha256":"fac0574e1a8570588bd6016b87eec5dd6367fccd7e0e07f1e79e2f2076b5eef3"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"19:45","verified":false,"words":"Yes, sir. I will give it to him and tell him exactly what you said. No need to worry about the name, sir."},{"id":"2026-10-27:statement:578413bae6115ef2:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":13,"sha256":"578413bae6115ef21163db54bc7a42aeda6beed4a71a28cccdc238cc98a64c0c"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"20:00","verified":false,"words":"You may go, Ramesh. The matter is settled."},{"id":"2026-10-27:statement:3daeb8db57d7fd93:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":14,"sha256":"3daeb8db57d7fd939fa617adab087e2e93f487559e9f80fff7a9d600dcfb080f"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"20:00","verified":false,"words":"Yes sir. Good night."},{"action":"eat","end":"19:15","id":"2026-10-27:event:8ef0cb7ee09df3b6:1","kind":"event","place":"home","source":{"collecti